      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "KING HENRY.\nHere at the palace will I rest a while.\nCousin of Exeter, what thinks your lordship?\nMethinks the power that Edward hath in field\nShould not be able to encounter mine.",
