      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "And, lords, towards Coventry bend we our course,\nWhere peremptory Warwick now remains.\nThe sun shines hot, and, if we use delay,\nCold biting winter mars our hoped-for hay.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
